This directory contains the upstream one-to-one call implementation and its
tests. Group calls are omitted. Tuigram carries this narrow copy because the
upstream public API does not expose channel-negotiation overrides.

Local changes correct V2 channel negotiation against Telegram's official
tgcalls implementation: answers acknowledge the offered sending SSRC; the
other direction is advertised by an independent offer. Tests cover official
answer semantics and independent offers in addition to local RTP loopback.

Reference: https://github.com/TelegramMessenger/tgcalls/blob/development/tgcalls/v2/ContentNegotiation.cpp

Keep transport changes small and reconcile this directory when the upstream
implementation supports these exchanges. The rest of gotd stays a normal
versioned module dependency.
